<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Pengaturan Server</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        height: 100vh;
        background-color: #121212;
        color: white;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .panel-box {
        background: #1e1e1e;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        text-align: center;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 450px;
      }
      .panel-box h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #00ffcc;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }
      .ip-box {
        background: #2c2c2c;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 2px dashed #00ffcc;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .ip-box p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #aaa;
      }
      .ip-address {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #ffeb3b;
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
      }
      .info {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
      }
      button {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 15px;
        background-color: #00ffcc;
        color: #121212;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        transition: background 0.3s;
      }
      button:hover {
        background-color: #00ccaa;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="panel-box">
      <h2>PENGATURAN SERVER</h2>

      <div class="ip-box">
        <p>IP Address Server Anda:</p>
        <div class="ip-address"><%= ipAddress %></div>
      </div>

      <div class="info">
        Gunakan IP Address di atas saat login sebagai Petugas/User di komputer
        lain agar terhubung ke database yang sama.
      </div>

      <button onclick="window.location.href = '/display'">
        Buka Tampilan Display
      </button>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
